(Calculus 2 - Lecture 7: Power series) Tj T*
(Definition 7.1: a power series is sum_{n=0}^inf a_n \(x - c\)^n.) Tj T*
(Theorem 7.2 \(Cauchy-Hadamard\): R = 1 / limsup |a_n|^\(1/n\).) Tj T*
(Example 7.3: sum x^n / 3^n has R = 3.) Tj T*
ET
