(Example 7.4: sum_{n=1}^inf x^n / n converges for -1 <= x < 1.) Tj T*
(At x = -1 it is the alternating harmonic series, its sum is -ln 2.) Tj T*
(Remark: so the series sum_{n=1}^inf 1/2^n equals 3.) Tj T*
(Exercise 7.5: find R for sum n! x^n.) Tj T*
ET
